# The backend lives on its own `backend` branch and is not part of `main`.
# Its working-tree copy on this branch is a checkout leftover, not source.
# (node_modules/.env/dist are covered by duka_pos_backend/.gitignore on the
# backend branch itself.)
/duka_pos_backend/

# Local agent tooling and vendored third-party skills — machine-local only,
# never part of the project source. Provenance lives in
# .kilo/skills/ATTRIBUTION.md on disk.
/.kilo/

# OS / editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp

# Signing material — defence in depth. duka_pos_app/android/.gitignore already
# covers these; the rules are repeated at the repo root so a keystore generated
# anywhere else in the tree (a scratch copy, a keytool run from the home
# directory) is still refused by git. Losing this material is unrecoverable for
# app updates: a new key means every shop device must reinstall and re-pair.
*.jks
*.keystore
key.properties
*.jks.bak*
keystore-base64.txt

# Dependency / build / artifact clutter — never source control
node_modules/
dist/
.env
*.log
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins
build/
*.zip
session-ses_*.md